<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Informe de Ejecución QA - {{ result.trace_id }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --primary: #2563eb;
      --success-bg: #dcfce7;
      --success-text: #15803d;
      --success-border: #86efac;
      --failed-bg: #fee2e2;
      --failed-text: #b91c1c;
      --failed-border: #fca5a5;
      --warning-bg: #fef3c7;
      --warning-text: #b45309;
      --warning-border: #fde68a;
      --info-bg: #ede9fe;
      --info-text: #6d28d9;
      --info-border: #ddd6fe;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.5;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
    header {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .header-title h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
    .header-title p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 4px; }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .badge-passed, .badge-success { background: var(--success-bg); color: var(--success-text); border-color: var(--success-border); }
    .badge-failed { background: var(--failed-bg); color: var(--failed-text); border-color: var(--failed-border); }
    .badge-error { background: var(--warning-bg); color: var(--warning-text); border-color: var(--warning-border); }
    .badge-incomplete, .badge-blocked { background: var(--info-bg); color: var(--info-text); border-color: var(--info-border); }
    .badge-interrupted { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; border-color: #cbd5e1; }
    
    nav.quick-nav {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
    nav.quick-nav a {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    nav.quick-nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .metric-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .metric-number { font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); }
    .metric-label { font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px; }

    section {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    section h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 8px; }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    th, td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    tr:hover td { background: #f8fafc; }

    pre {
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-family: Consolas, Monaco, "Courier New", monospace;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    details {
      margin-top: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #fafafa;
    }
    details[open] { background: #ffffff; }
    summary {
      padding: 10px 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      user-select: none;
    }
    summary:hover { background: #f1f5f9; }
    .details-content { padding: 12px 16px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }

    .tag {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: #334155;
      font-family: monospace;
    }
    a.artifact-link {
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
    }
    a.artifact-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">

  <header>
    <div class="header-title">
      <h1>Informe de Ejecución QA</h1>
      <p>Traza: <strong>{{ result.trace_id }}</strong> | Alcance: {{ result.scope_note }}</p>
      <p>Inicio: {{ result.start_utc }} | Fin: {{ result.end_utc }} | Duración: {{ "%.2f"|format(result.duration_seconds) }}s</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="badge badge-{{ result.status|lower }}">{{ result.status }} (Código {{ result.exit_code }})</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="quick-nav">
    <a href="#summary">Resumen</a>
    <a href="#suites">Suites ({{ result.suites|length }})</a>
    {% if result.counts.failed > 0 or result.counts.errors > 0 %}
    <a href="#failures" style="color: var(--failed-text);">Fallos ({{ result.counts.failed + result.counts.errors }})</a>
    {% endif %}
    <a href="#steps">Pasos de Preparación</a>
    <a href="#ai-analysis">Análisis IA</a>
    <a href="#artifacts">Artefactos ({{ manifest.artifacts|length if manifest else 0 }})</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- 1. Métricas Globales -->
  <div class="metrics-grid" id="summary">
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="metric-number">{{ result.counts.collected }}</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Casos Recolectados</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="metric-number" style="color: var(--success-text);">{{ result.counts.passed }}</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Aprobados</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="metric-number" style="color: var(--failed-text);">{{ result.counts.failed }}</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Fallidos</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="metric-number" style="color: var(--warning-text);">{{ result.counts.errors }}</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Errores</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="metric-number" style="color: var(--text-muted);">{{ result.counts.skipped + result.counts.xfail }}</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Omitidos / XFail</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
      <div class="metric-number">{{ "%.2f"|format(result.duration_seconds) }}s</div>
      <div class="metric-label">Duración Total</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. Suites -->
  <section id="suites">
    <h2>Suites de Prueba</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Suite</th>
          <th>Estado</th>
          <th>Motor</th>
          <th>Aprobados</th>
          <th>Fallidos</th>
          <th>Errores</th>
          <th>Duración</th>
          <th>Procedencia / Versiones</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for suite in result.suites %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ suite.suite_id }}</strong></td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-{{ suite.status|lower }}">{{ suite.status }}</span></td>
          <td>{{ suite.engine }}</td>
          <td>{{ suite.counts.passed }}</td>
          <td>{{ suite.counts.failed }}</td>
          <td>{{ suite.counts.errors }}</td>
          <td>{{ "%.2f"|format(suite.duration_seconds) }}s</td>
          <td>
            {% if suite.provenance and suite.provenance.tool_versions %}
              {% for tool, ver in suite.provenance.tool_versions.items() %}
                <span class="tag">{{ tool }}: {{ ver }}</span>
              {% endfor %}
            {% else %}
              <span class="text-muted">No registrada</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. Fallos y Diagnósticos -->
  {% set failed_cases = [] %}
  {% for case in result.cases %}
    {% if case.status in ['FAILED', 'ERROR'] %}
      {% set _ = failed_cases.append(case) %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  {% if failed_cases|length > 0 %}
  <section id="failures">
    <h2 style="color: var(--failed-text);">Casos Fallidos y Errores ({{ failed_cases|length }})</h2>
    {% for case in failed_cases %}
    <details open>
      <summary>
        <span class="badge badge-{{ case.status|lower }}">{{ case.status }}</span>
        <strong>{{ case.name }}</strong> ({{ case.classname or case.suite_id }}) - {{ "%.3f"|format(case.duration_seconds) }}s
      </summary>
      <div class="details-content">
        {% if case.message %}
        <p><strong>Diagnóstico:</strong></p>
        <pre><code>{{ case.message }}</code></pre>
        {% else %}
        <p class="text-muted">Sin mensaje de error explícito registrado.</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if case.suite_id %}
        <p style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.8125rem;">
          Artefactos de suite:
          <a class="artifact-link" href="../{{ case.suite_id }}/junit.xml">{{ case.suite_id }}/junit.xml</a>
        </p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- 4. Pasos de Preparación / Build / Typecheck (Separados de casos) -->
  <section id="steps">
    <h2>Pasos de Preparación y Compilación</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px;">
      Los pasos de infraestructura y compilación se registran independientemente y no alteran los conteos de casos de prueba.
    </p>
    {% set all_steps = [] %}
    {% for suite in result.suites %}
      {% for step in suite.steps %}
        {% set _ = all_steps.append((suite.suite_id, step)) %}
      {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}

    {% if all_steps|length > 0 %}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Suite</th>
          <th>Paso</th>
          <th>Descripción</th>
          <th>Tipo</th>
          <th>Estado</th>
          <th>Duración</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for suite_id, step in all_steps %}
        <tr>
          <td><span class="tag">{{ suite_id }}</span></td>
          <td><code>{{ step.step_id }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ step.description }}</td>
          <td>{{ step.kind }}</td>
          <td><span class="badge badge-{{ step.status|lower }}">{{ step.status }}</span></td>
          <td>{{ "%.2f"|format(step.duration_seconds) }}s</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">No se registraron pasos de preparación independientes.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <!-- 5. Bloqueos y Capacidades -->
  {% if result.capabilities|length > 0 %}
  <section id="capabilities">
    <h2>Capacidades y Entorno</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Capacidad</th>
          <th>Categoría</th>
          <th>Requerido</th>
          <th>Disponible</th>
          <th>Versión / Ruta</th>
          <th>Detalle</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for cap in result.capabilities %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ cap.name }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ cap.category }}</td>
          <td>{{ "Sí" if cap.required else "Opcional" }}</td>
          <td>
            {% if cap.available %}
              <span class="badge badge-passed">Disponible</span>
            {% else %}
              <span class="badge badge-error">Ausente</span>
            {% endif %}
          </td>
          <td><code>{{ cap.version or cap.path or "-" }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ cap.reason or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </section>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- 6. Análisis IA (Diferenciado y Optativo) -->
  <section id="ai-analysis">
    <h2>Análisis Inteligente (Optativo)</h2>
    {% if analysis and analysis.status != "DISABLED" %}
      <div style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
        <span class="badge badge-{{ analysis.status|lower }}">{{ analysis.status }}</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.875rem; margin-left: 8px;">Proveedor: <strong>{{ analysis.provider }}</strong> (Modelo: <code>{{ analysis.model }}</code>) | Duración: {{ "%.2f"|format(analysis.duration_seconds) }}s</span>
      </div>
      {% if analysis.error_reason %}
        <p style="color: var(--failed-text); font-size: 0.875rem;"><strong>Motivo de bloqueo o error:</strong> {{ analysis.error_reason }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if analysis.hypotheses|length > 0 %}
        <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Hipótesis Deterministas</h3>
        {% for hyp in analysis.hypotheses %}
        <details open>
          <summary>
            <span class="tag">Probabilidad: {{ hyp.likelihood }}</span> {{ hyp.cause }}
          </summary>
          <div class="details-content">
            {% if hyp.suggested_action %}
            <p><strong>Acción sugerida:</strong> {{ hyp.suggested_action }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if hyp.referenced_evidence %}
            <p style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.8125rem;">
              <strong>Evidencia referenciada:</strong>
              {% for ref in hyp.referenced_evidence %}
                <span class="tag">{{ ref }}</span>
              {% endfor %}
            </p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </details>
        {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
      {% if analysis.prompt_tokens or analysis.total_tokens %}
      <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
        Consumo de tokens: Prompt: {{ analysis.prompt_tokens or 0 }} | Completado: {{ analysis.completion_tokens or 0 }} | Total: {{ analysis.total_tokens or 0 }}
      </p>
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem;">
        Análisis IA no solicitado o desactivado. El veredicto de pruebas se basa 100% en oráculos deterministas locales.
      </p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <!-- 7. Manifiesto de Artefactos Relocalizables -->
  <section id="artifacts">
    <h2>Manifiesto de Artefactos de Evidencia</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px;">
      Todos los enlaces son relativos a este paquete de evidencias. Mover la carpeta preserva la integridad y validez de los enlaces.
    </p>
    {% if manifest and manifest.artifacts|length > 0 %}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>ID</th>
          <th>Ruta Relativa</th>
          <th>Tipo</th>
          <th>Tamaño</th>
          <th>Hash SHA-256</th>
          <th>Procedencia</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for art in manifest.artifacts if art.path != "report/report.html" and not art.path.endswith(".html") %}
        {% set href_link = art.path if art.path.startswith("report/") else "../" + art.path %}
        {% if art.path.startswith("report/") %}
          {% set href_link = art.path[7:] %}
        {% endif %}
        <tr>
          <td><code>{{ art.id }}</code></td>
          <td><a class="artifact-link" href="{{ href_link }}">{{ art.path }}</a></td>
          <td><span class="tag">{{ art.type }}</span></td>
          <td>{{ art.size_bytes }} B</td>
          <td><code style="font-size: 0.6875rem;">{{ art.sha256[:16] }}...{{ art.sha256[-8:] }}</code></td>
          <td>{{ art.provenance or "-" }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% else %}
    <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">No se encontraron artefactos registrados en el manifiesto.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>Agente Local de Pruebas &copy; 2026. Documento estático auto-contenido generado sin dependencias remotas.</p>
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
